## 4. Frontend & User Experience (UX) Principles

* **Luxury Color Palette:** Deep obsidian (`#0b0e14`), champagne gold accents (`#d4af37`), and muted silver create an atmosphere reflective of high-end private banking and luxury horology.
* **Audio-Visual Feedback:** Web Audio / Synthesizers (like Tone.js) deliver instant auditory confirmation (gavel drops, bid confirmations) simulating the tactile feel of an in-person auction hall.
* **Glassmorphism & Telemetry:** Semi-transparent panels with backdrop filters display real-time lot counters without obstructing imagery.

